AWPTCM-T9558 (1.0) — MAC/Phy TLV: port speed 10 duplex=auto
tb470 IE520 stack · 2026-09-03 · RESULT: testCaseExcl (not producible on this platform)

10 Mbit is rejected on every IE520 front port, including empty ports (port-level, no module):
  speed 10  ->  "% <port>: Unsupported speed/duplex combination"
Neither copper SFP (AT-SP10TM 10G-T, AT-SPTXc 1000-T) nor a bare port offers 10 Mbit.
See port-capability-matrix.txt.
Disposition: testCaseExcl — 10 Mbit unsupported on this platform. Not a defect.
